OL,3,APolice told Russell Brand to leave
OL,4,AJemima Goldsmith's house in 2014
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoldsmith, who dated the disgraced
OL,7,Fentertainer for roughly a year, wrote
OL,8,Fon X on Monday that she "had to call
OL,9,Fthe police to have him removed from my
OL,10,Fhouse in 2014 during a violent
OL,11,Fincident" but chose not to press
OL,12,Fcharges.
